How to use this project to learn practical na theoretically:
--------------------------------------------------------------
1. Containers understanding
2. Dependency Injection
       I. Setter DI
            - Primitive type DI
            - Secondery (Object) type DI
                -- ref approach
                -- inherit bean approach
            - Collection primitive DI
                - default collection DI like List, Set Map
                - child type collection DI like ArrayList, HashSet, HashMap basically child classes
            - Collection secondery (Object) DI
            - Properties DI
            - Array Secondery type DI
        how to make setter injection also mandatory by using dependency-check attribute in config.xml
        for primitive types it will be dependency-check="simple" -- so we are making all primitive dependencies
        inside that class is mandatory of setter injection
        for not primitive we can use  dependency-check="objects"
        if you want all mandatory use dependency-check="all"
         ---- OR ---
         you can use @Required annotation for each setter method.


       II. Construction DI
              - Primitive type DI
              - Secondery (Object) type DI
              - Collection primitive DI
                    - default collection DI like List, Set Map
                    - child type collection DI like ArrayList, HashSet, HashMap basically child classes
              - Collection secondery (Object) DI
              - Properties DI